   "statement": "Only a portion of requests fail (avg 14.7%, max 34.7% 5xx), so the route table problem may affect only some gateway instances or some routes.",
   "evidence_ids": [
    "ev-88327707148b"
   ]
  },
  {
   "statement": "The failures affect several routes: POST /checkout appeared in 14 of the 20 sampled error traces and GET /products in 6.",
